From: CarlosDLMC <delamorenacoco.carlos@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 20:39:31 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] feat: drag a written text to move it

With the pointer or the text tool, pressing on a text that is already
written picks it up (outlined) and dragging moves it; one undo step per
move. The text being typed keeps its clicks; it is committed first when
another text is picked up.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
